@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Community Guidelines";
}

<div class="container-fluid mt-4">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
        <div>
            <h1 class="h3 mb-1">Community Guidelines</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                Clear, empowering, and protective standards that keep the Pathfinder mission strong.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Back to Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">The Pathfinder Code</h2>
            <p>
                Welcome to a community built on strategic growth and exuberant leadership. To ensure every Pathfinder
                has the support they need to unlock socioeconomic progress, we all agree to the following:
            </p>

            <h3 class="h6 mt-4">1. Lead with Vision</h3>
            <p class="mb-2"><strong>Innovate Boldly:</strong> We prioritize ideas that seek long-term solutions for community challenges.</p>
            <p><strong>Share Knowledge:</strong> Entrepreneurship is a team sport; help fellow Pathfinders by sharing practical insights and support.</p>

            <h3 class="h6 mt-4">2. Strategic Integrity</h3>
            <p class="mb-2"><strong>Transparency First:</strong> Our grants are built on trust. Always provide honest updates on project milestones and financial allocations.</p>
            <p><strong>Accountability:</strong> Own your journey. We celebrate progress, but we also value the lessons learned from setbacks.</p>

            <h3 class="h6 mt-4">3. Collaborative Spirit</h3>
            <p class="mb-2"><strong>Build Partnerships:</strong> Seek out strategic connections within the app. We are stronger when our initiatives intersect.</p>
            <p><strong>Respect the Network:</strong> Treat every mentor, partner, and peer with the professional courtesy that a global leader commands.</p>

            <h3 class="h6 mt-4">4. Safe and Inclusive Spaces</h3>
            <p class="mb-2"><strong>Zero Tolerance:</strong> Harassment, discrimination, or exploitative behavior will result in immediate removal from the initiative.</p>
            <p><strong>Empower Others:</strong> Use your platform to lift others up, ensuring our exuberant energy is accessible to everyone.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Our Commitment to You</h2>
            <p>As a Pathfinder, you are not just an applicant; you are a partner. We commit to providing:</p>
            <ul class="mb-0">
                <li><strong>Prompt Feedback:</strong> We value your time as an entrepreneur.</li>
                <li><strong>Strategic Resources:</strong> Beyond funding, we provide the tools to help your venture scale.</li>
                <li><strong>A Secure Platform:</strong> Your data and your dreams are safe with us.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
